<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46170" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζεύγλ-η</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>loop attached to the yoke</i>
				(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζυγόν</span>), through which the beasts'
			heads were put, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαίτη ζεύγλης ἐξεριποῦσα παρὰ ζυγόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					17.440
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔζευξα . . ἐν ζυγοῖσι κνώδαλα
					ζεύγλαισι δουλεύοντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					463
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποδύντες ὑπὸ τὴν ζ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.31
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόας ζεύγλᾳ πέλασσεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					4.227
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπάγειν τοὺς ἵππους τῇ
			ζ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMar.</u>
				6.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζεῦγος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1507
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>.—Not found in good 
				Att.
			 Prose. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>cross-bar</i> of the double rudder, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				1536
			</span></i>.</div>
